
# type(scope): summary
#
# - Why the change is needed
# - What changed
#
# Write your message above these instructions using the format shown here.
# Write in English using printable ASCII characters, including all footers.
# Comments and verbose diffs in the message file must also use ASCII text.
# Subject: at most 50 characters. Do not end it with a period.
# Add a blank line, then exactly two bullets (at most 120 characters each, including '- ').
# type: feat fix docs style refactor perf test build ci chore revert
# scope examples: app ui navigation auth data domain network database di resources build deps git
# Optional footers after a blank line: Closes #12, Refs: #12
# Breaking changes: type(scope)!: summary + BREAKING CHANGE: impact and migration
# Full rules: .github/CONTRIBUTING.md
